    "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral и любой сервер, совместимый с OpenAI (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter). Ключ — только в связке ключей macOS; «Проверить» не тратит токены.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral and any OpenAI-compatible server (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter). The key lives only in the macOS Keychain; “Check” spends no tokens."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral y cualquier servidor compatible con OpenAI (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter). La clave se guarda solo en el llavero de macOS; «Comprobar» no gasta tokens."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral et tout serveur compatible OpenAI (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter). La clé est gardée uniquement dans le trousseau macOS ; «Vérifier» ne consomme aucun jeton."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral e qualquer servidor compatível com OpenAI (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter). A chave fica só nas Chaves do macOS; «Verificar» não gasta tokens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
